That's why I'm taking care of the meter.

1129
01:32:52,633 --> 01:32:53,633
Do you hear me?

1130
01:32:54,602 --> 01:32:56,632
I'm going outside.

1131
01:32:56,733 --> 01:33:01,104
I'll keep the door open, because I'm on the stairs.

1132
01:33:01,204 --> 01:33:03,773
If you call, I can hear you.

1133
