I promised you.

1192
01:37:34,653 --> 01:37:38,234
I'll see you at the altar of prayer.

1193
01:37:41,595 --> 01:37:47,815
- Lord, please don't move that mountain.

1194
01:37:49,334 --> 01:37:52,435
Give me the strength to climb that mountain.

1195
01:37:56,847 --> 01:37:58,506
When's the exam?

1196
01:38:00,048 --> 01:38:01,048
Tomorrow is the day.

1197
01:38:05,917 --> 01:38:07,258
How are you doing?

1198
01:38:11,629 --> 01:38:12,629
Of course I did.

1199
01:38:52,174 --> 01:38:53,594
Thank you. Thank you.

1200
01:39:02,857 --> 01:39:05,556
- What are you doing?

1201
01:39:09,057 --> 01:39:12,168
I'm done with it, or I'm going somewhere.

1202
01:39:12,267 --> 01:39:14,488
I've got a place to go.

1203
