1214
01:40:02,425 --> 01:40:04,796
I'll run upstairs and get it for you, Mr. Fromm.

1215
01:40:04,896 --> 01:40:09,677
No, I have to go to Carr's bank by 4:00.

1216
01:40:13,265 --> 01:40:15,537
- I'll give it back.

1217
01:40:15,636 --> 01:40:19,217
Five dollars is enough. Thank you. Thank you.

1218
01:40:32,619 --> 01:40:35,389
It's over. Room assignment is over.

1219
