Yeah, well, I'm not going to break it.

1230
01:42:42,108 --> 01:42:47,709
Otherwise, you're gonna be sleeping in the same room with me for the rest of your life.

1231
01:42:47,808 --> 01:42:49,151
I don't care about that.

1232
01:42:50,149 --> 01:42:51,570
I'll take care of it.

1233
01:43:08,273 --> 01:43:10,732
Get some sleep, all right?

1234
01:43:10,841 --> 01:43:11,842
