1268
01:46:29,231 --> 01:46:32,492
Sometimes I hear people laughing.

1269
01:46:36,503 --> 01:46:39,042
The next day, after work...

1270
01:46:40,072 --> 01:46:42,413
We went to the beach.

1271
01:46:42,513 --> 01:46:44,513
Far away from everything.

1272
01:46:44,613 --> 01:46:45,613
From everything.

1273
01:46:46,184 --> 01:46:48,404
It's just me and Christopher.

1274
01:46:49,484 --> 01:46:51,945
- Have you seen me?

1275
01:46:52,055 --> 01:46:55,074
Far away from the buses and noise.

1276
01:46:55,364 --> 01:47:00,706
And the constant disappointment in my head...

